    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics feels like a language I’ve learned to speak fluently through computer science and biology. I see patterns in data and equations, which helps me solve real-world problems. While I enjoy the logical structure, I sometimes struggle with abstract concepts that don’t connect to my daily experiences.",
